<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<p>Ref No: {{{Case.CaseNumber}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},<br />
<br />
File Reference - {{{Case.Baggage_File_Reference__c}}}<br />
<br />
Thank you for your patience while we assessed your claim.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
We’ve determined that your damaged bag is unsuitable for repair and would like to offer you a replacement or reimbursement.<br />
&nbsp;</p>
<strong>If&nbsp;customer&nbsp;would like&nbsp;reimbursement,&nbsp;please provide the details below:&nbsp;</strong>

<p>As you have requested reimbursement for your damaged baggage, we have now completed our assessment. A payment of&nbsp;&lt;$00.00&gt; AUD&nbsp;can be processed to your nominated&nbsp;&lt;bank account/credit card&gt;&nbsp;</p>

<p><strong>If the customer would like a replacement, please provide the details below:&nbsp;</strong><br />
&nbsp;<br />
We’ve partnered with Delsey - a Paris-based supplier trusted by airline crew around the world - enabling us to offer tamper-proof bags with a five-year warranty equipped with TSA locks.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
<strong>Pick out your new Delsey bag</strong><br />
<br />
You're all set for a replacement bag similar in size and style to your old one - just choose your favourite from the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/adobe/assets/urn:aaid:aem:9fc5127e-4f76-44bd-9485-ae7395a62094/original/as/qantas_catalogue_lutece_se_2026.pdf"><span style="color:#2980b9;">Qantas Delsey Brochure</span></a><strong> </strong>and select the following:</p>

<ul>
	<li>Baggage type (e.g. Lutece SE)</li>
	<li>Size (in cms and similar to your old one)</li>
	<li>Colour (where the colour selected is unavailable, we'll replace it with an available colour option for the baggage)</li>
</ul>

<p>&nbsp;<br />
<strong>Delivery of your replacement</strong><br />
<br />
Please download and complete the attached <a href="https://www.qantas.com/adobe/assets/urn:aaid:aem:8fa28000-e641-4a90-be87-6147c8490876/original/as/baggage-replacement-release-form.pdf"><span style="color:#2980b9;">Replacement bag selection form</span></a> and return it by replying to this email along with your baggage selection.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
Make sure you provide a residential or business address, as replacement bags can't be delivered to a PO Box.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
Your replacement bag will be delivered during business hours between 9:00am to 5:00pm, and since we're unable to leave the delivery unattended, please make sure someone is available to receive it.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
We look forward to welcoming you onboard again soon.<br />
<br />
Once again, on behalf of the team at Qantas, we apologise for the inconvenience experienced. We are confident that you will be delighted with your new baggage and thank you again for your understanding.</p>
</body>
</html>